# Anything carrying non-public event material stays local.
*.private.md
dossier/
preflight.sarif
# ...but the committed examples under docs/ are the point: they let someone read the output
# without installing anything. These patterns match at any depth, so they need explicit rescue.
!docs/example-output/dossier/
!docs/example-output/dossier/**
!docs/example-output/preflight.sarif
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.env
*.log
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
node_modules/
.DS_Store
out/
fixtures/**/secrets*
